\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Rises Above Key Level; USD Below S$1.6590 \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 November 1999\par 03:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar broke through a key resistance level midmorning Monday, but dealers say its gains will be constrained by fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0245 GMT (9:45 p.m. EST Sunday), the U.S. dollar was at S$1.6587, weaker than the S$1.6682 seen late Friday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Dealers had said that last week's low of S$1.6590 was a key support level for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been drifting downward in recent weeks against the Singapore dollar and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the Singapore dollar's gains could be capped at the current level for fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the MAS. "You have to be careful just below S$1.66," said a dealer at a U.S. bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar has generally moved in tandem with the Thai baht and the Indonesian rupiah. A stronger rupiah following the recent presidential election is lending the Singapore dollar strong support, dealers say. \par \par \uc2  However, with the Indonesia calmer following the election, the Singapore dollar will once again start looking to the dollar-yen for direction, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "There's a feeling in the market now that we're back to a scenario of lower dollar-yen," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  At 0300 GMT (10 p.m. EST Sunday), the dollar was trading at Y103.94, down from Y104.13 late Friday in New York. \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz; 65/ 421-4802; christopher.wellisz@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvb107rx0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
