\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Weaken; Singapore Dlr Down To Month Low \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 1999\par 10:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Risk aversion ahead of the U.S. Federal Open Market Committee meeting coupled with the dollar's overnight run-up against the yen pushed Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Among the biggest falls was that of the Singapore dollar, which dropped to its lowest level so far this month, propelled in part by sales executed by the local \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to dealers. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the Philippine peso fell to a nine-month low during intraday trading, despite verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials aimed at supporting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Talk in the Singapore market Tuesday morning centered around rumors that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market the night before, buying U.S. dollars during New York trading hours to weaken the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The MAS is said by traders to have bought U.S. dollars on a number of occasions recently, in pursuit of its efforts to enhance Singapore's export competitiveness. \par \par \uc2  From a low Monday night of around S$1.6720, the U.S. dollar rose steadily to hit an intraday high of S$1.6912 Tuesday in Asia, as both U.S. and Singapore banks bid heavily for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  According to a trader at one U.S. bank it was "highly likely" that the MAS had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to initiate the move. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, the principal reason for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rally was a growing aversion to risk ahead of the FOMC meeting later Tuesday, he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 24-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0830GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8o0685n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
