\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Weaker Late As U.S. Dlr Gains Vs Euro, Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 1999\par 12:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar is weaker late Tuesday as sentiment toward the U.S. dollar improves, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Some traders added that there are signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is thought to be seeking a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to promote exports. \par \par \uc2  At about 1026 GMT (6:26 a.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar was at S$1.6791, up from S$1.6737 early Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar is up against the euro and the yen, so this move comes as no surprise," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Midday, the U.S. dollar pushed to a recent high of S$1.6833 at a time when liquidity was unusually poor because of the lunch-time break, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Although the U.S. dollar fell back somewhat, it can be expected to hold onto some of its gains against the Singapore dollar and other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't likely to fall below the level of $S1.6745, one dealer said, adding that it could rise to between S$1.6950 and S$1.7000 in the next few days. \par \par \uc2  The release of U.S. consumer price data later in the day will be a key event, dealers say. If fears of a U.S. interest rate increase ease, the U.S. dollar could gain against the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a Western bank said the level of S$1.6850 will be an important one for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "If we break that, the recent downtrend will be completely negated," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  In the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market, the overnight rate was offered at 0.500%, down from 1.000% late Monday, while the three-month rate was offered at 2.500%, down from 2.625% late Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-08-99 \par \par \uc2  1036GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8h063zx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
