\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Weaken As Investor Sentiment Cools \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 1999\par 10:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended local trading hours lower across the board Friday, weakening against the U.S. dollar for the third day in a row as foreign investor sentiment toward local stock markets showed signs of cooling. \par \par \uc2  The majority of analysts kept a brave face, however, maintaining their bullish view towards regional markets despite Friday's selloff. \par \par \uc2  "I think this is a nice, healthy shakeout of some of the more speculative positions," said Andrew Fung, treasury economist at Standard Chartered Bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  Although some foreign investors were bailing out of regional stocks and \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , worried that local markets may be overheating, any selloff would merely represent a buying opportunity for the longer-term investors Asia needs to help fund economic recovery, said Fung. \par \par \uc2  "As we see more positive economic numbers coming out, we will see long-term investors stepping in to take advantage of any dips in the market," he predicted. \par \par \uc2  Other market watchers broadly agreed, but warned that the selloff may drive Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower still over the coming week, before they can establish a firm bottom. \par \par \uc2  Much of the swing in sentiment toward the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been propelled by the slide in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar since the local \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market late Tuesday to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 09-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0830GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv79056nv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
