\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Down On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Position Squaring \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juli 1999\par 10:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and position liquidation combined to drive Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower against the U.S. dollar during local trading hours Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Although most observers retain their fundamentally positive outlook on Asia's economic recovery, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers are becoming less sure that improving growth prospects will translate into further short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation. \par \par \uc2  Sentiment towards the Singapore dollar took an especially hard knock after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  made a rare admission, confirming it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market late Tuesday to weaken the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the authorities in South Korea reiterated their determination to rein in the appreciation of the won, driving that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sharply lower. \par \par \uc2  Fears that the Bank of Thailand may follow the example of the MAS and the Bank of Korea and enter the market to buy U.S. dollars helped to push the baht down, although the baht found firm support at the floor of its recent range. \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso was sold off too, although dealers